{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChL7Qx59DYBCdZwPSUkJD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I routed issue #49 as `done`: it goes to engineer triage (`next: [triage:engineer]`) and then to the engineer worker. The decision is in `.ard/49/triage-lead.md`.\n\n- **Why engineer only:** engineer is the only triage role besides lead and the only worker defined in this repository. The plan already in the issue covers the design and the docs.\n- **Why it's ready:** the change is a new starter scanner role under `internal/roles/scanners/`, modelled on the existing `cve` scanner, and it needs no controller changes. The owner has answered all five of the plan's open questions, and the issue it depends on (#23) is reported as merged.\n- **No extra review routing:** `eng-review` is the only reviewer and has no `when:` rule, so it already runs on every pull request.\n\nThe file's \"Open issues\" section tells maintainers four things:\n- The pull request edits `CLAUDE.md`, which is a protected path, so it will wait for a human approval before merge.\n- Two steps need a person because worker jobs have no Docker: checking the base-image digest and running the integration test once.\n- It will have small text conflicts with the other pull requests that add starter roles, so those should land one at a time.\n- Product, architecture and documentation planning roles don't exist here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":763,"cache_read_input_tokens":18748,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":763},"output_tokens":417,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"914ea9c0-2525-4eaa-a7b3-3afb356aae38","uuid":"2885500e-95a1-4fcb-acd8-006d385793b1","t